# Your own extra egress allowlist entries, added on top of image/allowed-domains.txt
# (shared defaults) and harnesses/<name>/allowed-domains.txt. Copy this file to
# allowed-domains.txt (gitignored; build.sh does it for you on the first build) and add
# whatever your workflows need - e.g. an MCP server's API host. Rebuild afterwards.
#
# Squid dstdomain ACL: one entry per line. A leading "." matches the domain itself and
# every subdomain; without it, only that exact host matches.
#
# To replace the whole list for one session instead, use run.sh --allow-list <file>.

# .example.com
